            <p class="about-stats__label">Happy Students</p>
            <p class="about-stats__sub">Across India</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="about-stats__item">
          <span class="about-stats__icon about-stats__icon--orange" aria-hidden="true">
            <i class="feather-file-text"></i>
          </span>
          <div class="about-stats__copy">
            <p class="about-stats__metric">1,200+</p>
            <p class="about-stats__label">Projects &amp; Reports</p>
            <p class="about-stats__sub">Diverse Domains</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="about-stats__item">
          <span class="about-stats__icon about-stats__icon--blue" aria-hidden="true">
            <i class="feather-star"></i>
          </span>
          <div class="about-stats__copy">
            <p class="about-stats__metric">4.9/5</p>
            <p class="about-stats__label">Average Rating</p>
            <p class="about-stats__sub">From Our Students</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="about-stats__item">
          <span class="about-stats__icon about-stats__icon--green" aria-hidden="true">
            <i class="feather-headphones"></i>
          </span>
          <div class="about-stats__copy">
            <p class="about-stats__metric">24/7</p>
            <p class="about-stats__label">Support</p>
            <p class="about-stats__sub">Always Available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========= OUR STORY / MISSION / VISION ========= -->
  <section class="about-story" aria-labelledby="about-story-title">
    <div class="about-story__grid">

      <div class="about-story__copy">
        <p class="about-story__eyebrow">Our Story</p>
        <h2 id="about-story-title" class="about-story__title">
          From a Small Idea to a Student <em>Success Partner</em>
        </h2>
        <p class="about-story__lead">
          FileMakr started with a simple mission – to make final year projects easier and
          stress-free for students. What began as a small initiative has now grown into a
          trusted platform used by thousands of students across India.
        </p>
        <p class="about-story__tagline">Your success is our motivation.</p>
      </div>

      <article class="about-story__card">
        <span class="about-story__card-icon about-story__card-icon--orange" aria-hidden="true">
          <i class="feather-target"></i>
        </span>
        <h3 class="about-story__card-title">Our Mission</h3>
        <p class="about-story__card-text">
          To provide high-quality, original and practical academic resources that help
          students learn better, perform better and achieve their goals.
        </p>
        <span class="about-story__rule about-story__rule--orange" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </article>

      <article class="about-story__card">
        <span class="about-story__card-icon about-story__card-icon--blue" aria-hidden="true">
          <i class="feather-eye"></i>
        </span>
        <h3 class="about-story__card-title">Our Vision</h3>
        <p class="about-story__card-text">
          To become the most reliable academic partner for students in India and empower
          them with the right tools for a successful future.
        </p>
        <span class="about-story__rule about-story__rule--blue" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========= WHY STUDENTS CHOOSE FILEMAKR ========= -->
  <section class="about-choose" aria-labelledby="about-choose-title">
    <header class="about-choose__head">
      <p class="about-choose__eyebrow">Why Students Choose FileMakr</p>
      <h2 id="about-choose-title" class="about-choose__title">Quality. Trust. Results.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="about-choose__grid">

      <article class="about-choose__card">
        <span class="about-choose__icon about-choose__icon--blue" aria-hidden="true">
          <i class="feather-code"></i>
        </span>
        <h3 class="about-choose__card-title">Industry Relevant <br/> Projects</h3>
        <p class="about-choose__card-text">Work on real-world projects and in-demand technologies.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="about-choose__card">
        <span class="about-choose__icon about-choose__icon--green" aria-hidden="true">
          <i class="feather-shield"></i>
        </span>
        <h3 class="about-choose__card-title">Plagiarism Free <br/> Reports</h3>
        <p class="about-choose__card-text">AI-checked &amp; plagiarism free reports for your confidence.</p>
